        <summary>Higher notification importance: shows everywhere, makes noise and peeks.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Higher notification importance: shows everywhere, makes noise and peeks. May use full screen intents. May have elevated prominence in appearance or shade ranking. Usage is reserved by OS; app usage is capped at IMPORTANCE_HIGH.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/NotificationManager#IMPORTANCE_MAX" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.NotificationManager.IMPORTANCE_MAX</code>.</a></format></para>
